  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_e840e8e2-cb86-4829-89e4-1090742b9876.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>這個材質包變更了盔甲與武器的設計（目前僅限基礎款），盔甲外觀主要參考 YouTube 創作者 Farfadox 的設定背景，希望各位喜歡，我將隨時獲得靈感時更新此專案。</strong></p>\n<h5>西班牙語：此材質包變更了盔甲與武器的設計（目前僅限基礎款），盔甲外觀主要參考 YouTuber Farfadox 的設定背景，希望各位喜歡，我將隨時獲得靈感時更新此專案。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>感謝大家下載量突破 12 萬！！！！</strong></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>我愛你們所有人</strong></span></h1>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_97e9c4cd-3ad1-4672-b5c3-7d47834a6a5f.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"230\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_fcbc9a50-6616-4b5a-b3b4-50262196cccc.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"229\"></h5>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_01ff85e6-a960-4e94-8618-80efe187223a.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"229\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_f0944130-5751-4a92-8112-8dd13025a6ef.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">材質更新：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">學習了一些光影技術後，我將對所有盔甲和武器的顏色進行大幅修改；我會在此公布變更內容。<br><br></span></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_ecf4a8ed-8dc7-498b-9dff-fa4ca3ad7cc6.png\" width=\"506\" height=\"633\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_54fd3b75-8427-4dbb-9012-8ef1929ef83b.png\" width=\"507\" height=\"635\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span><span><iframe style=\"width:784px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wk8o9psl40o?si=z3XXWz7ugAIsU019\" width=\"784\" height=\"459\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/T8DRgje\" alt=\"\" width=\"NaN\" height=\"NaN\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_42d1c51e-03d7-4150-867a-bcd62f58d1f3.png\" alt=\"FF\" width=\"783\" height=\"440\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h5><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e03e2d\"><em><strong>此材質不得由第三方散布，或偽稱是您的作品並藉此獲利。若您想將其用於影片製作，請在影片資訊或結尾字幕中附上本連結。</strong></em></span></h5>",
